      "questionName": "shopping mall, lantern, bamboo tree, paper fan",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Write suitable words to complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/set_1_-_local_community_1_e7de6330.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p>Linda: Hey, Tom! I went to the local fair near the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>12.1</label><input id='fbo-903401-0' class='ms fillblank-option-12' index='0' name='fbo-903401-0' type='text' size='17' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903401-0' /></span></strong> yesterday. It was so much fun!</p>\n<p>Tom: That sounds great! What did you see there?</p>\n<p>Linda: They had beautiful <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>12.2</label><input id='fbo-903401-1' class='ms fillblank-option-12' index='1' name='fbo-903401-1' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903401-1' /></span></strong> in different colors everywhere. They made the fair feel festive.</p>\n<p>Tom: Wow, that must have looked amazing! Did you buy anything?</p>\n<p>Linda: Yes, I bought a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>12.3</label><input id='fbo-903401-2' class='ms fillblank-option-12' index='2' name='fbo-903401-2' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903401-2' /></span></strong>. It was really hot that day!</p>\n<p>Tom: Good choice! Did they have any handicrafts there?</p>\n<p>Linda: Many. I saw a stall with <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>12.4</label><input id='fbo-903401-3' class='ms fillblank-option-12' index='3' name='fbo-903401-3' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903401-3' /></span></strong>. They looked so comfortable and unique.</p>\n<p>Tom: That sounds interesting! I've never seen such things. I'll visit the fair next time.</p>\n<p>Linda: You should! It&#8217;s nice to see our community organizing such fun events.</p>",
