      "questionText": "<p><strong>Read the conversation and then choose the correct answer to fill in each blank.</strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Hi, Tom! I went to the local market in the nearby village this morning. The <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-903511-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-903511-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903511-0'></option><option value=\"composers\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903511-0-composers'>composers</option><option value=\"artisans\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903511-0-artisans'>artisans</option></select></span></strong> there makes beautiful pottery.</p>\n<p>Tom: That sounds amazing! What do they make the pottery <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-903511-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-903511-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903511-1'></option><option value=\"by\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903511-1-by'>by</option><option value=\"from\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903511-1-from'>from</option></select></span></strong>?</p>\n<p>Anna: They use clay from the nearby river to make all sorts of things. I&#8217;m really impressed by their skill.</p>\n<p>Tom: Wow! I want something special to buy for my parents. Maybe I should check it out.</p>\n<p>Anna: You should! I think you&#8217;ll find something perfect. The people in the village are <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-903511-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-903511-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903511-2'></option><option value=\"asking\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903511-2-asking'>asking</option><option value=\"looking\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903511-2-looking'>looking</option></select></span></strong> for young clever people. They want to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-903511-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-903511-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903511-3'></option><option value=\"put\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903511-3-put'>put</option><option value=\"hand\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903511-3-hand'>hand</option></select></span></strong> down their techniques to the younger generation to preserve the traditional handicraft.</p>",
